WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:09.449
The rail on the left is the menu. It has seven places: Home, Objects, Runs, Fix, Rules, Master data and Migration.

2
00:00:09.449 --> 00:00:20.404
Point at Objects: the menu lists the systems and their objects, and a link to connect a system. Every place opens a menu like this, and Pin keeps it open.

3
00:00:20.404 --> 00:00:27.062
Fix holds the Action centre, Work, verified fixes, Cleansing, Requests and People. The badge counts open items.

4
00:00:27.062 --> 00:00:33.067
Rules holds the rules, the dry run, anomaly rules, learned monitors and the evidence ledger.

5
00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:39.729
Master data holds MDM health, the entry gate, reference data, record links, Material 360 and data mining.

6
00:00:39.729 --> 00:00:44.984
Migration holds S/4HANA readiness, go-live, the forecast, value delivered and configuration.

7
00:00:44.984 --> 00:00:50.234
Reports, the Atlas and Administration sit under More, below the rail.

8
00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:55.040
Press g then a letter to jump: g then o opens Objects.

9
00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.845
The letter completes the jump.
